# MMOSkillTamingPack - Italian (it-IT) display text for the MMO Skill Tree mod.
# Convention keys: quest.<id>.title|flavor and achievement.<id>.title|desc resolve through
# the mod's QuestTitleUtil / AchievementTextUtil seams (the raw displayName/description were
# removed from the JSON in 1.4.0). Values are data-free flavor only: no digits, no restating
# objective/reward amounts (the UI auto-renders those). Translations live in the sibling
# Languages/<locale>/mmoskilltree.lang files.

